          "end": 30.42,
          "en": "if you have little or no React knowledge.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 30.42,
          "end": 32.94,
          "en": "Because if you got some knowledge already,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
